    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Looking for a cozy and modern living space? Look no further than this charming two-bedroom rental property!\n\nNestled in a very quiet and safe neighbourhood in Palmerstown, this property is newly decorated and boasts a recently fitted kitchen and bathroom. The bedrooms are comfortable, with ample wardrobe space, hight ceilings and natural light. \n\nThe property also features a unique spiral staircase leading up to the bedrooms, adding character and charm to the space. The kitchen is fully equipped with all the necessary appliances, including a hob, integrated fridge freezer, and a new washing machine.\n\nWith its prime location this rental property is the perfect choice for those looking for a comfortable and convenient place to call home. Don't miss out - schedule a showing today! Deposit required. Minimum 2 year lease. Rent paid in advance. No pets. Please supply a CV and references. This property is suitable for 2 persons, or couples with a maximum of 2 children under 10. This is a non-smoking Residential House."
      }
    ],
